{
  "plugin": "nrl-scoreboard",
  "_comment": "Games are seeded onto the per-mode sub-managers, not the plugin: the scoreboards keep their state on self._managers, and every mode's display() returns early unless games_list is populated. display_mode picks which screen is drawn -- without it the plugin's no-argument path selects nothing and renders blank. The card reads home_logo_path/away_logo_path off the game dict as Path objects; the docs shim coerces the *_path strings. Logos come from the core's assets/sports/nrl_logos, which is why the renderer runs with the LEDMatrix root as its working directory. Teams, scores and records are invented. The bundled PEN/MEL logo files are grey placeholders -- real crests are fetched at runtime by the core's logo downloader -- so they render as grey blocks here.",
  "defaults": {
    "width": 128,
    "height": 32,
    "scale": 6,
    "freeze_time": "2026-09-13T09:50:00+00:00",
    "skip_update": true,
    "config": {
      "enabled": true
    }
  },
